  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x17d;enski centar: Support for GBV Victims in the Highly Underdeveloped Region of Eastern Herzegovina &#x2013; Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Foundation &quot;&#x17d;enski centar&quot; Trebinje&apos;s project &#x201c;Support for GBV Victims in the Highly Underdeveloped Region of Eastern Herzegovina &#x2013; Phase II&quot; is the continuation of the project of the same name - Phase 1 (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB-BA5) under the 2024-2025 programme &#x201c;The Kvinna till Kvinna Regional Programme - Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&#x201d; (Ref: SE-ON-802401-6134-WB).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents 2.0&quot; the partner organisation Foundation &quot;&#x17d;enski centar&quot; Trebinje is implementing a 8 month project in Bosnia and Herzegovina. The project aims to provide support for victims of GBV in Eastern Herzegovina. The primary pillars of the programme is a counseling center focused on economic empowerment of women victims of GBV and trainings for police and social workers involved in GBV cases.</narrative>
  </description>
